        reproducibility: "Full Monte Carlo simulation and analysis suite included with publication release.",
        data_retention_policy: "Physical observables (plaquette action densities, Wilson loops, correlators, topological susceptibility) were computed in-situ and stream-reduced during HMC trajectory evolution on GPU cluster scratch. Raw intermediate 4D gauge link field arrays (~430 GB across ensembles) were transient on ephemeral cluster instances and discarded post-analysis to conserve storage, with all extracted physics colocated in this repository.",
    ),
    verification: (
        checksum_algorithm: "BLAKE3",
        manifest_signature: "single_pass_blake3_merkle_tree",
    ),
